  "genome_description": "Self-blinking LED for the esp32_led controller. LED Enable = run latch (stimulate to start), LED Stop = inhibits the latch (stimulate to stop), Blink Clock = square wave (consecutive fire count = on bursts, snooze period = off bursts), morphology \"LED brightness\" vector z picks brightness (z=0 100%, z=9 10%). 20 Hz burst rate.",
